                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female member of congress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cfcb15c-ae46-3a89-8cb3-3e5bde1a62c8",
                                        "entry_id": "e7d18bf9-f664-3b79-bd34-52fa9905c9b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female member of the House of Representatives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe144394-4b95-49e7-9f64-ae5a6521a32d",
                                                "sense_id": "8cfcb15c-ae46-3a89-8cb3-3e5bde1a62c8",
                                                "text": "When they got to talking, these five would-be congresswomen realized that they had a lot in common, despite being from different parts of the country: they all had careers in national security they were trying to parlay into elected office."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0615bb9-8b6c-428b-9ced-702a61361dd2",
                                                "sense_id": "8cfcb15c-ae46-3a89-8cb3-3e5bde1a62c8",
                                                "text": "Representative Nancy Pelosi, our California congresswoman, has affirmed that the United States stands “unwaveringly” by Israel as it conducts its defense[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7f297be-885a-4afa-a4da-14c6443d379b",
                                                "sense_id": "8cfcb15c-ae46-3a89-8cb3-3e5bde1a62c8",
                                                "text": "President-elect Donald J. Trump on Wednesday chose Tulsi Gabbard, a former Democratic congresswoman who became one of his most enthusiastic backers, to serve as the director of national intelligence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
